From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:09:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/39] G4 cont4 checkpoint 1.2: the return home after the
 right pass

Region (a) of Build/ZoneRebalance: 48 new private zr_ declarations, no
public change, no admission.

- zr_stepContract: the one-cell leaf restricted to its constant verdict
  for any index and precondition; zr_rulerStepContract is now its
  instance (proofs that unfold it name zr_stepContract too).
- The return loop on the public phase host: the home test (two leaves),
  the body (skip back, then test), the dispatch and body phase contracts,
  one round by round_iff, the orbit, Round.iterate, and the loop contract
  zr_loopContract (time zoneStart L + 8 (L + 1)).
- zr_returnContract: the skip over the new zone's outer half, then the
  loop; zr_rightReturnContract: zr_rightPassRow sequenced into it by
  Contract.seq, with the explicit instance zr_decEqRP, the real link and
  the proved hlink (zr_rightReturn_link); its precondition, endpoint,
  time and envelope lemmas.

Region (c): the extension row's status paragraph updated.

